  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add grated ginger and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add garlic paste and sauté for 30 seconds.",
    "Add minced turmeric and sauté for 30 seconds.",
    "Add chicken stock and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add enchilada sauce and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for 2 minutes or until the sauce has thickened.",
    "Add rice noodles and toss to coat with the sauce.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes or until the noodles are heated through.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve hot."
